  "remarks": "Limited Liability Company “MORSKOY STANDARD” is a shipping company based in Russia and the commercial operator of the vessels Protey, Peley and Akhilles. Those vessels lack adequate liability insurance and engage in ship-to-ship transfers and manipulation of Automatic Identification Systems while transporting crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia. Therefore, Limited Liability Company “MORSKOY STANDARD” operates vessels that transport crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organization General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
